# 统一换行与编码：Win 下 .bat 必须 CRLF，脚本与文档保持 UTF-8
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.jsp text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.svg text eol=lf
